          <msContents>
            <summary>LIBVRE accomply de secrets chimiques pour distillations, sublimations, cimentations, congélations, fixations, transmutations, calcinations, blancs, rouges, lune, soleil, et pierres précieuses en toute perfection. Avec sa partie ajoincte de médicaments excellents. The leaf facing the title has a pen-drawn astrological diagram illustrating the 'Science Platonicque du futur contingent' and the last two leaves contain astrological tables. Part of the second section (72 pp.) is in Italian with some words in a alphabetical cypher. The last section is a 'Déclaration ou exposition de l'horloge critique et médicinale'.</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="" source="IANA">French</textLang>
